{"instruction": "Can you help me write a q function named choleski that perform data operations for a trading system", "input": "", "output": "choleski:{\n n:count A:x+0.0;\n if[1>=n;:sqrt A];\n p:ceiling n%2;\n X:p#'p#A;\n Y:p _'p#A;\n Z:p _'p _A;\n T:(flip Y) mmu inv X;\n L0:n #' (choleski X) ,\\: (n-1)#0.0;\n L1:choleski Z-T mmu Y;\n L0,(T mmu p#'L0),'L1}"}
