{"instruction": "In q/kdb+, Write a q function named subscribe that establish connections or subscriptions for a trading system", "input": "", "output": "subscribe:{[tabs;instrs;setschema;replaylog;proc]\n  // if proc dictionary is empty then exit - no connection\n  if[0=count proc;.lg.o[`subscribe;\"no connections made\"]; :()];\n\n  // check required flags are set, and add a definintion to the reconnection logic\n  // when the process is notified of a new connection, it will try and resubscribe\n  if[(not .sub.reconnectinit)&.sub.AUTORECONNECT;\n    $[.servers.enabled;\n      [.servers.connectcustom:{x@y;.sub.autoreconnect[y]}"}
{"instruction": "Write q code for writedownconfig to execute a query and return results", "input": "", "output": "writedownconfig:{\n  if[0=count .dqe.tosavedown`.dqe.configtable;:()];\n  .dqe.savedata[.dqe.dqcdbdir;.dqe.getpartition[];.dqe.tosavedown`.dqe.configtable;`.dqe;`configtable];\n  /- get handles for DBsthat need to reload\n  hdbs:distinct raze exec w from .servers.SERVERS where proctype=`dqcdb;\n  /- send message for DB\n  .dqe.notifyhdb[.os.pth .dqe.dqcdbdir]'[hdbs];\n  }"}
