{"instruction": "Create a q/kdb+ function search to perform data operations efficiently", "input": "", "output": "search:{[s;c]\n\tif[not 10h=type s,:(); '\"search value must be a string (character array)\"]; \n\traze {[f;s;c] \n\t\tres:([]function:enlist f;definition:enlist def:last value value f);\n\t\t$[not 10h=type def; 0#res;\n\t\t  $[c;\n\t\t\t(def like s)#res;\n\t\t\t(lower[def] like lower[s])#res]]}"}
