{"instruction": "I need to write a q function that validate data in a production environment", "input": "", "output": "checkstatus:{[apicall;status;frequency;timeout]\n  res:value apicall;\n  st:.z.t;\n  l:0;\n  while[(timeout>ti:.z.t-st) & not any res[`status] like/: status; \n     if[frequency<=ti-l;\n            l:ti;\n            res:value apicall; \n            .lg.o[`checkstatus;\"Status: \", res[`status], \" waited: \", string(ti)];\n     ];\n   ];\n   .lg.o[`checkstatus;\"Status: \",res[`status]];\n   :res; \n }"}
